  "description": "BEMBOO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C110 H88 Lu4 N2 O17,3.5(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Lu1 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu2 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu3 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors; Lu4 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors; Lu5 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu6 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors; Lu7 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors; Lu8 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.518-3.625 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.53-113.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Lu4(μ4-O)(L3)2(DBM)6]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
